## 6.1 NASA GPM IMERG

Official source:

https://gpm.nasa.gov/data/imerg

Use the current officially supported IMERG product and version, discovered from NASA metadata.

Prioritise Early Run for low-latency rainfall context when available.

Support Late and Final products for their appropriate use cases.

Retrieve and process:

- Precipitation rate.
- Precipitation accumulation.
- Observation interval.
- Granule ID.
- Product version.
- Spatial resolution.
- Quality information.
- Actual source timestamp.

Use official NASA Earthdata/GES DISC or PPS access methods.

Implement real authentication where required.

Handle different product units correctly.

Never sum rainfall rates as if they were accumulated rainfall.

Never label 10-km satellite estimates as direct rain-gauge readings.

## 6.2 NASA SMAP

Official source:

https://nsidc.org/data/smap

Implement appropriate SMAP L4 products:

- SPL4SMAU.
- SPL4SMGP.

Also evaluate appropriate enhanced L3 soil-moisture products when they provide more timely radiometer observations for a supported use case.

Retrieve:

- Surface moisture.
- Root-zone moisture where available.
- Product version.
- Observation date.
- Publication/availability date.
- Native resolution.
- Quality flags.
- Physical units.

SMAP L4 products provide approximately 9-km and three-hourly temporal information, but the archive may have around seven days of latency.

Respect actual product availability.

Do not claim that three-hourly observation cadence means data is published every three hours.

Never present SMAP as a direct field probe.

## 6.3 NASA POWER

Official API:

https://power.larc.nasa.gov/docs/services/api/

Implement hourly and daily API requests using actual field coordinates.

Support appropriate meteorological parameters after checking current official parameter definitions.

Potential inputs:

- Temperature.
- Maximum and minimum temperature.
- Relative humidity.
- Precipitation.
- Solar radiation.
- Wind parameters where supported.
- Relevant agroclimatology parameters.

Preserve source units and time standards.

